<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>About | Amic Biotech</title>

<style>

*{
margin:0;
padding:0;
box-sizing:border-box;
font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
}

body{
background:#f4f8fd;
color:#222;
}

.about{
padding:90px 10%;
}

.container{
max-width:1200px;
margin:auto;
display:grid;
grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;
align-items:center;
gap:70px;
}

.text h1{
font-size:60px;
color:#0d5bd1;
margin-bottom:25px;
}

.text p{
font-size:21px;
line-height:1.8;
color:#555;
margin-bottom:22px;
}

.text strong{
color:#1565c0;
}

.btn{
display:inline-block;
margin-top:20px;
padding:18px 38px;
background:#1565c0;
color:white;
text-decoration:none;
font-weight:bold;
border-radius:12px;
transition:.3s;
}

.btn:hover{
background:#0f4ca8;
}

.image img{
width:100%;
border-radius:24px;
box-shadow:0 20px 50px rgba(0,0,0,.12);
}

@media(max-width:900px){

.container{
grid-template-columns:1fr;
}

.text h1{
font-size:42px;
}

}

</style>

</head>

<body>

<section class="about">

<div class="container">

<div class="text">

<h1>About Amic Biotech</h1>

<p>
<strong>Amic Biotech</strong> is a biotechnology company dedicated to improving people's health through science, innovation, and evidence-based nutrition.
</p>

<p>
We believe everyone deserves access to safe, reliable, and high-quality healthcare products. Our mission is to research, develop, and deliver premium nutritional supplements that support healthier lives.
</p>

<p>
Innovation is at the heart of our company. We continuously explore biotechnology, artificial intelligence, and scientific research to create better products while maintaining the highest standards of quality and transparency.
</p>

<p>
Our long-term vision is to become a trusted global biotechnology company recognized for scientific excellence, responsible innovation, and improving health around the world.
</p>

<a href="/research" class="btn">
Learn About Our Research
</a>

</div>

<div class="image">

<img src="/images/hero.png" alt="Amic Biotech">

</div>

</div>

</section>

</body>
</html>
